      "extract": "We would like to mention that our result (theorem [\\[index\\]](#index){reference-type=\"ref\" reference=\"index\"}) is derived from the purely algebraic fact ([\\[FFS\\]](#FFS){reference-type=\"ref\" reference=\"FFS\"}) about the cohomology of Lie algebra of matrices over the Weyl algebra. In this respect our approach is very reminiscent of finding \"local\" proofs of the Riemann-Roch-Hirzebruch theorem [@ACKP], [@BS], [@BNT],",
